Jacob, I've been playing around for the last half hour and this as close as can get to do everything inside ggplot.

ggplot(data = DUT, aes(sample = stuff)) + stat_qq() +
 geom_smooth(method = "lm", aes(x = ..theoretical.., y = ..sample..), stat = "qq")

The issue it seems, one can't get stat_smooth play nice with stat_qq

Luciano

