> > >> but again it makes no use of the concept of statistical transformations
> > as
> > >> implemented in ggplot2.
> >
> > >> In the normal quantile plot, the statistical transformation transforms
> > the
> > >> sample into two vectors: the theoretical and sample quantiles. The
> > qqnorm()
> > >> function returns them as x and y, and we exploited them above.
